# Each player puts a creature card from their graveyard onto the battlefield, but a player with none puts nothing and is
# not asked. Bot1 entombs a Llanowar Elves and Bot2 entombs a Lightning Bolt (no creature); on turn 3 Exhume returns only the
# Elves and Bot2 is asked nothing (the refused Choose); the Bolt stays in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Entomb
Exhume
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Llanowar Elves
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Entomb
Swamp x8
Lightning Bolt
Swamp x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Llanowar Elves)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot2.Search(Lightning Bolt)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Exhume.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves)
! Bot2.Choose
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Swamp; Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Graveyard = Entomb; Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Battlefield = Swamp
